<title>NEW ZEALAND: Citibank ups NZ fixed mortgage rates, not variable.</title>
<headline>Citibank ups NZ fixed mortgage rates, not variable.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Zealand unit of Citibank said on Monday it had raised its current fixed mortgage rates with the sharpest rise in its one-year fixed rate, up to 9.40 percent from 8.60 percent.</p>
<p>In a statement the bank said its variable of floating home loan rate remained unchanged at 8.95 percent.</p>
</text>
